.SS "char * wget_xml_decode_entities_inline (char * src)"

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIsrc\fP A string 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A pointer to \fRsrc\fP, after the XML entities have been converted
.RE
.PP
Decode XML entities from \fRsrc\fP\&.

.PP
\fBThe transformation is done inline\fP, so \fRsrc\fP will be modified after this function returns\&. If no XML entities have been found, \fRsrc\fP is left untouched\&.

.PP
Only a small subset of available XML entities is currently recognized\&. 
